        {
            "id": 11651,
            "question_id": 23716,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "uk",
            "hint": "Лексична основа: rehearse — репетирувати. Умова описує процес до минулого моменту, а не лише завершений результат. Збережи причину, протиставлення або часовий зв’язок, названі в умові.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11652,
            "question_id": 23716,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Preserve the order of the semantic parts; keep the opening time, concession or topic phrase first. Contrast weeks of rehearsal with a later forgotten line; begin with the concession.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11653,
            "question_id": 23716,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: rehearse. Describe the process leading up to a past point, not merely a finished result. Preserve the stated cause, contrast or time relation.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11654,
            "question_id": 23716,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "pl",
            "hint": "Użyj Past Perfect Continuous dla wcześniejszego procesu. Zachowaj kolejność części znaczeniowych; początkowe wyrażenie czasu, przyzwolenia lub tematu pozostaw na początku. Chociaż ćwiczyła już od kilku tygodni, i tak zapomniała jednej kwestii.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11655,
